---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_EMAIL } from '../consts';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
	<head>
		<BaseHead title={`Terms of Service - ${SITE_TITLE}`} description="Terms of Service and usage guidelines" />
	</head>
	<body>
		<Header />
		<main>
			<article class="terms-of-service">
				<div class="hero">
					<h1>📜 Terms of Service</h1>
					<p class="updated">Last updated: March 5, 2026</p>
				</div>

				<div class="content">
					<section>
						<h2>1. Acceptance of Terms</h2>
						<p>By accessing and using AI Knowledge Hub, you accept and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. If you do not agree to these terms, please do not use our services.</p>
					</section>

					<section>
						<h2>2. Description of Service</h2>
						<p>AI Knowledge Hub provides educational content about Artificial Intelligence, Machine Learning, Computer Vision, and related technologies through:</p>
						<ul>
							<li>Free blog articles and tutorials</li>
							<li>Premium subscription content (when available)</li>
							<li>Educational resources and guides</li>
						</ul>
					</section>

					<section>
						<h2>3. User Accounts</h2>
						
						<h3>3.1 Account Creation</h3>
						<p>To access premium features, you may be required to create an account. You agree to:</p>
						<ul>
							<li>Provide accurate and complete information</li>
							<li>Keep your password secure and confidential</li>
							<li>Notify us immediately of any unauthorized access</li>
							<li>Be responsible for all activities under your account</li>
						</ul>

						<h3>3.2 Account Termination</h3>
						<p>We reserve the right to suspend or terminate accounts that violate these terms or engage in fraudulent activities.</p>
					</section>

					<section>
						<h2>4. Premium Subscriptions</h2>
						
						<h3>4.1 Subscription Plans</h3>
						<p>We offer premium subscription plans that provide:</p>
						<ul>
							<li>Unlimited access to all premium articles</li>
							<li>Exclusive tutorials and content</li>
							<li>Downloadable resources</li>
							<li>Priority support</li>
						</ul>

						<h3>4.2 Billing</h3>
						<ul>
							<li><strong>Payment:</strong> Subscriptions are billed in advance on a monthly or yearly basis</li>
							<li><strong>Auto-renewal:</strong> Subscriptions automatically renew unless cancelled</li>
							<li><strong>Price Changes:</strong> We may change prices with 30 days notice</li>
							<li><strong>Refunds:</strong> 7-day money-back guarantee for new subscribers</li>
						</ul>

						<h3>4.3 Cancellation</h3>
						<p>You can cancel your subscription at any time. Upon cancellation:</p>
						<ul>
							<li>You will retain access until the end of your billing period</li>
							<li>No refund for the current billing period (except within 7-day guarantee)</li>
							<li>You can resubscribe at any time</li>
						</ul>
					</section>

					<section>
						<h2>5. Intellectual Property</h2>
						
						<h3>5.1 Our Content</h3>
						<p>All content on AI Knowledge Hub (articles, code examples, images, videos) is protected by copyright and other intellectual property rights. You may:</p>
						<ul>
							<li>✅ Read and learn from our content</li>
							<li>✅ Share links to our articles</li>
							<li>✅ Use code examples in your projects (with attribution)</li>
						</ul>
						
						<p>You may NOT:</p>
						<ul>
							<li>❌ Copy or redistribute our content without permission</li>
							<li>❌ Use our content for commercial purposes without license</li>
							<li>❌ Remove copyright or attribution notices</li>
							<li>❌ Share premium content with non-subscribers</li>
						</ul>

						<h3>5.2 User-Generated Content</h3>
						<p>If you submit comments or feedback, you grant us a non-exclusive license to use, modify, and display such content.</p>
					</section>

					<section>
						<h2>6. Acceptable Use</h2>
						<p>You agree NOT to:</p>
						<ul>
							<li>Violate any laws or regulations</li>
							<li>Infringe on intellectual property rights</li>
							<li>Share account credentials with others</li>
							<li>Attempt to circumvent payment or access controls</li>
							<li>Use automated tools to scrape our content</li>
							<li>Engage in any activity that disrupts our services</li>
						</ul>
					</section>

					<section>
						<h2>7. Disclaimers</h2>
						
						<h3>7.1 Educational Purpose</h3>
						<p>Our content is for educational purposes only. We make no guarantees about:</p>
						<ul>
							<li>Accuracy or completeness of information</li>
							<li>Suitability for specific purposes</li>
							<li>Results from using our tutorials or code</li>
						</ul>

						<h3>7.2 Third-Party Links</h3>
						<p>We may link to third-party websites or resources. We are not responsible for the content or practices of these external sites.</p>

						<h3>7.3 Service Availability</h3>
						<p>We strive for 99% uptime but do not guarantee uninterrupted access. We may perform maintenance or updates that temporarily affect availability.</p>
					</section>

					<section>
						<h2>8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
						<p>To the maximum extent permitted by law, AI Knowledge Hub shall not be liable for:</p>
						<ul>
							<li>Indirect, incidental, or consequential damages</li>
							<li>Loss of profits, data, or opportunities</li>
							<li>Damages resulting from use or inability to use our services</li>
						</ul>
						<p>Our total liability shall not exceed the amount you paid for premium subscription (if applicable).</p>
					</section>

					<section>
						<h2>9. Advertising</h2>
						<p>We use Google AdSense to display advertisements. We are not responsible for the content of third-party ads. Ad blockers may affect your experience but will not prevent access to free content.</p>
					</section>

					<section>
						<h2>10. Privacy</h2>
						<p>Your use of our services is also governed by our <a href="/privacy-policy">Privacy Policy</a>. Please review it to understand how we collect and use your data.</p>
					</section>

					<section>
						<h2>11. Changes to Terms</h2>
						<p>We may update these Terms of Service at any time. Continued use of our services after changes constitutes acceptance of the new terms.</p>
					</section>

					<section>
						<h2>12. Governing Law</h2>
						<p>These terms are governed by the laws of Vietnam. Any disputes shall be resolved in the courts of Vietnam.</p>
					</section>

					<section>
						<h2>13. Contact Information</h2>
						<p>For questions about these Terms of Service:</p>
						<ul>
							<li>📧 Email: <a href={`mailto:${SITE_EMAIL}`}>{SITE_EMAIL}</a></li>
							<li>🌐 Website: <a href="/">AI Knowledge Hub</a></li>
						</ul>
					</section>

					<div class="agreement-notice">
						<h3>✅ Agreement</h3>
						<p>By using AI Knowledge Hub, you acknowledge that you have read, understood, and agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.</p>
					</div>
				</div>
			</article>
		</main>
		<Footer />
	</body>
</html>

<style>
	main {
		width: 100%;
		max-width: 900px;
		margin: 0 auto;
		padding: 2rem 1rem;
	}

	.terms-of-service {
		background: white;
		border-radius: 12px;
		padding: 2rem;
		box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.08);
	}

	.hero {
		text-align: center;
		padding-bottom: 2rem;
		border-bottom: 2px solid #f0f0f0;
		margin-bottom: 2rem;
	}

	.hero h1 {
		margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
		font-size: 2.5rem;
		color: #333;
	}

	.updated {
		color: #666;
		font-style: italic;
		margin: 0;
	}

	.content section {
		margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
	}

	.content h2 {
		color: #667eea;
		margin: 2rem 0 1rem 0;
		font-size: 1.8rem;
		border-left: 4px solid #667eea;
		padding-left: 1rem;
	}

	.content h3 {
		color: #555;
		margin: 1.5rem 0 1rem 0;
		font-size: 1.3rem;
	}

	.content p {
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: #444;
		margin-bottom: 1rem;
	}

	.content ul {
		line-height: 1.8;
		color: #444;
		margin: 1rem 0;
		padding-left: 1.5rem;
	}

	.content li {
		margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
	}

	.content a {
		color: #667eea;
		text-decoration: none;
		border-bottom: 1px dotted #667eea;
	}

	.content a:hover {
		color: #764ba2;
		border-bottom-color: #764ba2;
	}

	.agreement-notice {
		background: linear-gradient(135deg, #22c55e 0%, #16a34a 100%);
		color: white;
		padding: 2rem;
		border-radius: 12px;
		margin-top: 3rem;
		text-align: center;
	}

	.agreement-notice h3 {
		color: white;
		margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
	}

	.agreement-notice p {
		color: white;
		margin: 0;
		opacity: 0.95;
	}

	@media (max-width: 768px) {
		.terms-of-service {
			padding: 1.5rem;
		}

		.hero h1 {
			font-size: 2rem;
		}

		.content h2 {
			font-size: 1.5rem;
		}

		.content h3 {
			font-size: 1.2rem;
		}
	}
</style>
